  "description": "Stylish City Living with a Parkside Setting - Welcome to Carrington Park, Northwood, Santry Modern 1, 2 & 3 Bedroom Apartments to Rent in Sought-After Development Property Overview Located in the heart of Northwood, Santry, Carrington Park offers an exceptional selection of 1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments available to rent in a peaceful, leafy setting just minutes from Dublin City Centre. Each apartment is thoughtfully laid out and finished to a high standard, offering bright, spacious interiors and all the comforts of modern living in a secure and well-maintained development. Key features include: Open-plan living/dining areas with generous natural light Fitted kitchens with appliances Large double bedrooms with built-in wardrobes Master ensuite and main bathroom (in selected units) Private balconies or terraces (varies per unit) Ample in-unit storage Designated parking space included* Location & Lifestyle Benefits Carrington Park is part of the wider Northwood Estate - a unique, parkland development that blends residential, commercial, and recreational amenities in one beautifully landscaped environment. Residents enjoy: Access to Santry Demesne Park, walking and cycling trails right on your doorstep Close proximity to Gulliver's Retail Park, shops, gyms, cafés, and restaurants Quick access to M1, M50, Dublin Airport, and major commuter routes Convenient to Beaumont Hospital, DCU, and Omni Shopping Centre Excellent public transport links with frequent Dublin Bus services Why Rent at Carrington Park Carrington Park is ideal for individuals seeking the perfect mix of city access and green, open surroundings. Secure, professionally managed development Landscaped communal grounds with mature trees Peaceful, park-side living with urban convenience About I-RES As an I-RES resident, you can be assured of: - Dedicated Property Manager - Reliable professional service, when you need it - Fully trained staff to support you at every stage - Inhouse maintenance team - 24-hour on-call support for emergencies such as loss of heat, water or essential services - Clear communications and point of contact via our resident portal Learn more at www.i-res.ie Note: We aim to reply to all requests as soon as possible, however as we receive a large number of enquiries, we may not be able to reply individually to all messages . For more information on our privacy practices, please visit our privacy statement https://www.iresreit.ie/IRES-REIT-Privacy Terms and conditions apply*",
